  "text_pages": [
    "Clubs, Circles & Associations｜TU Support – TOHOKU UNIVERSITY International Support Center –\nClubs, Circles & Associations\nInformation about University Clubs and Circles for International Students\nTohoku University offers a wide range of clubs and circles from which you can choose. If you want to get an insight into Japanese culture and interact with Japanese students, or just wish to practice your hobby, we hope this booklet helps you find a group that fits your interests.\nClubs, Circles & Associations Booklet\n(PDF)\nSNS\n東北大学国際サポートセンター（ISC）\nInternational Support Center (ISC)\nTohoku University\nCONTACT US\nCopyright (C) Tohoku University All Rights Reserved."
  ],
